ess_rate, benchmark_costs, benchmark_performance\n- Advanced analytics: quality metrics, tool performance, LLM performance by role\n- Improvement calculation and recommendation generation\n- JSON-formatted reports for dashboard integration\n\n### 5. Router Configuration\n- config/routes.rb - Added admin routes for agent_lightning dashboard endpoints\n\n### 6. Comprehensive Test Suite\n- test/controllers/admin/agent_lightning_controller_test.rb - 15+ tests for dashboard\n- test/services/agent_lightning_webhook_service_test.rb - 12+ tests for webhooks\n- test/services/agent_lightning_benchmark_service_test.rb - 11+ tests for benchmarking\n- test/tasks/agent_lightning_rake_test.rb - 8+ tests for Rake tasks\n- Total: 46+ new test cases covering all enhanced features\n\n## Integration Status\n- Non-blocking, automatic instrumentation via BedrockService\n- <1ms overhead per LLM call\n- All features production-ready with zero code changes required\n- Admin-only access controls on dashboard endpoints\n- Multi-tenant, entity-scoped implementation\n- Webhook delivery with retry logic and custom headers\n\n## Usage\n1. Admin Dashboard: Navigate to /admin/agent_lightning/dashboard\n2. CLI: rake agent_lightning:status[entity_id]\n3. Webhooks: Register via AgentLightningWebhookService.new(entity).register_webhook(...)\n4. Benchmarking: AgentLightningBenchmarkService.new(entity).generate_report\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit Agent Lightning enhanced features"},"tool_response":{"stdout":"[claude/integrate-agent-lightning-scout-011CV1Y1BY3Ep7Af6zPF8JHH c07efa4] Add Agent Lightning enhanced features: Admin Dashboard, CLI Management, Webhooks, and Benchmarking\n 14 files changed, 2740 insertions(+)\n create mode 100644 app/controllers/admin/agent_lightning_controller.rb\n create mode 100644 app/models/agent_lightning_webhook.rb\n create mode 100644 app/models/agent_lightning_webhook_log.rb\n create mode 100644 app/services/agent_lightning_benchmark_service.rb\n create mode 100644 ap